OL,3,APub's 'beloved' manager stabbed to
OL,4,Adeath in Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub has paid tribute to its "beloved"
OL,7,Fmanager after she was stabbed to death
OL,8,Fin Germany.
OL,10,FRebecca Bullock, 31, was attacked at
OL,11,FRosenheim station shortly before 01:00
OL,12,Flocal time (00:00 BST) on Sunday. She
OL,13,Fwas taken to hospital but later died.
OL,15,FBavarian Police said a 27-year-old
OL,16,FGerman man, of no fixed address, was
OL,17,Farrested at the scene and later
OL,18,Fdetained in a psychiatric hospital on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of murder.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
