OL,3,APub's 'beloved' manager stabbed to
OL,4,Adeath in Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe White Swan, in Whitchurch,
OL,7,FBuckinghamshire, said: "We are so
OL,8,Fdeeply sorry to say that our beloved
OL,9,FBecca passed away over the weekend
OL,10,Fwhilst away on holiday."
